["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Knowing the next step stops you from rushing past the one you are on. Five levels, each one earned in the field.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout warn\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>These levels are opinion: Hunt Mentor's ladder, not a rank BC gives. Where a level touches the law, the page is shown. Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 380\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"380\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Five levels, many seasons</text>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"300\" width=\"360\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n    <text x=\"40\" y=\"323\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. Rookie</text>\n    <text x=\"40\" y=\"343\">Licensed, safe, first trips with a partner</text>\n    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"238\" width=\"320\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6b9a6b\"/>\n    <text x=\"80\" y=\"261\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. Apprentice</text>\n    <text x=\"80\" y=\"281\">First animals, clean shots, meat home</text>\n    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"176\" width=\"280\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"199\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. Hunter</text>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"219\">Finds game alone, fills tags most years</text>\n    <rect x=\"140\" y=\"114\" width=\"240\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"137\" font-weight=\"bold\">4. Guide</text>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"157\">Puts others on game, supervises</text>\n    <rect x=\"180\" y=\"52\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"75\" font-weight=\"bold\">5. Old Timer</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"95\">Teaches and gives back</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#23261f\">Each step is seasons, not sessions. Opinion, not a rank BC gives.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Tick a box only after doing it in the field (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to use the ladder</summary><ul><li>Each level is seasons, not sessions (Tip).</li><li>Tick a box only when you have done it in the field, not read about it (Tip).</li><li>Your brother is on the same ladder. Climb it together and check each other (Tip).</li><li>Most hunters stay at Hunter for life, and that is a good place to be (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Level 1, Rookie, highlighted on a five rung ladder. Goal: safe, legal and out there. Key skills: licensed and MU rows read out loud; 10 shots in a 10 centimetre circle at 100 metres from a rest; always hunting with a partner. Opinion, not a BC rank.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Level 1: Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"204\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"66\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Old Timer</text><path d=\"M6 290 V30 M132 290 V30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".5\"/><rect x=\"146\" y=\"44\" width=\"244\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goal: safe, legal, out there</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"126\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 151) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M-14 -18 H8 L16 -10 V18 H-14 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 H10 M-8 2 H10 M-8 10 H4\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Licensed, MU rows read</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">aloud</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"184\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 209) scale(0.8)\"><circle r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -20 V-6 M0 6 V20 M-20 0 H-6 M6 0 H20\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">10 shots in 10 cm, 100 m</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"242\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 267) scale(0.8)\"><circle cx=\"-9\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 16 V2 Q-9 -5 0 2 V16 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M1 18 V4 Q10 -3 19 4 V18 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Always with a partner</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: Hunt Mentor&#x27;s ladder, not a BC rank.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the rookie goal in words</summary><ul><li>Goal: safe, legal, and out there (Tip).</li><li>Licensed, every firearm handled by <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ACTS\">ACTS</button> and <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"PROVE\">PROVE</button>, always hunting with a partner (Tip).</li><li>Season one is for learning the ground, not filling tags (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s6-rookie\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:0\"><span>FWID (Fish and Wildlife ID), basic licence and species licences bought for this year</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:1\"><span>Read my MU (Management Unit) rows on synopsis page 34 out loud to my brother</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:2\"><span>Rifle zeroed and 10 shots in a 10 cm circle at 100 m (109 yd) from a rest</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:3\"><span>Shotgun patterned with my bird load</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:4\"><span>Compass bearing walked to a landmark and back</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:5\"><span>Trip plan left before every hunt</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:6\"><span>Five days in the field, journal filled for each</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:7\"><span>Wind checked with a puffer or milkweed every hunt</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-rookie:8\"><span>Field dressing watched or done with help</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Level 2, Apprentice. Goal: first animals, clean shots, all the meat home. Key skills: licence notched on the spot; edible portions packed out and kept cool; passed on at least one shot that was too far or risky. Opinion, not a BC rank.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Level 2: Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"204\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"66\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Old Timer</text><path d=\"M6 290 V30 M132 290 V30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".5\"/><rect x=\"146\" y=\"44\" width=\"244\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goal: first animals, meat</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">home</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"126\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 151) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M-14 -18 H8 L16 -10 V18 H-14 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 H10 M-8 2 H10 M-8 10 H4\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Tag notched on the spot</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"184\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 209) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M-18 -4 Q-14 -18 6 -14 Q22 -10 18 6 Q12 18 -6 14 Q-20 10 -18 -4 Z\" fill=\"#c0504d\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-8 -2 Q2 -8 10 0\" stroke=\"#f5e0d8\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f0e0\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Edible portions home,</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">cool</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"242\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 267) scale(0.8)\"><circle r=\"18\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-7 -7 l14 14 M7 -7 l-14 14\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Passed on a bad shot</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: Hunt Mentor&#x27;s ladder, not a BC rank.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the apprentice goal in words</summary><ul><li>Goal: first animals, clean shots, all the meat home (Tip).</li><li>You plan most of the trip yourself. Your brother checks the plan (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s6-apprentice\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:0\"><span>First big game animal tagged on the spot, licence notched correctly</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:1\"><span>Edible portions packed out and kept cool</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:2\"><span>First limit or near limit of birds, every bird identified before the shot</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:3\"><span>Passed on at least one shot that was too far or too risky</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:4\"><span>Map scouted a hunt from home and found deer where the map said</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:5\"><span>Glassed up an animal before it saw me</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:6\"><span>Blood trailed a hit animal with a partner, or practised on a mock trail</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-apprentice:7\"><span>One full season of journal entries reviewed in January</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Level 3, Hunter. Goal: finds game alone and fills tags most years. Key skills: three or more seasons on the same ground; butchered a whole deer; turned around for weather, light or a bad wind. Opinion, not a BC rank.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Level 3: Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"204\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"66\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Old Timer</text><path d=\"M6 290 V30 M132 290 V30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".5\"/><rect x=\"146\" y=\"44\" width=\"244\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goal: finds game alone</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"126\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 151) scale(0.8)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-10 -18 v6 M10 -18 v6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-10 2 h4 M-2 2 h4 M6 2 h4 M-10 10 h4 M-2 10 h4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">3 or more seasons, same</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">ground</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"184\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 209) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M-20 6 L6 -4 Q16 -8 20 -12 Q18 2 6 6 Z\" fill=\"#cfd6bf\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-24\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" transform=\"rotate(-20 -17 6)\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Butchered a whole deer</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"242\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 267) scale(0.8)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"18.0\" y2=\"0.0\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"9.0\" y2=\"15.6\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-9.0\" y2=\"15.6\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-18.0\" y2=\"0.0\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-9.0\" y2=\"-15.6\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"9.0\" y2=\"-15.6\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Turned back for weather</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: Hunt Mentor&#x27;s ladder, not a BC rank.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the hunter goal in words</summary><ul><li>Goal: finds game alone, fills tags most years, never loses the plot on safety (Tip).</li><li>You make the calls. You still hunt with a partner because it is safer (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s6-hunter\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:0\"><span>Three or more seasons on the same ground</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:1\"><span>Found and killed a mature animal by spot and stalk or sitting a crossing</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:2\"><span>Butchered a whole deer myself</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:3\"><span>Applied to LEH (Limited Entry Hunting) for a planned hunt, with a backup choice</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:4\"><span>Hunted a new MU from map scouting alone and came home with a plan for next year</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:5\"><span>Turned around for weather, light or a bad wind, and was glad later</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:6\"><span>Shot practice every month of the off season</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-hunter:7\"><span>Can explain my MU rules without opening the synopsis, then checked I was right</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Level 4, Guide. Goal: puts others on game and keeps them safe. Law: supervising needs a hunting licence in at least 3 earlier licence years, and at most two youth or initiation hunters at once. Unpaid only: guiding for pay needs a guide licence.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Level 4: Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"204\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"66\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Old Timer</text><path d=\"M6 290 V30 M132 290 V30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".5\"/><rect x=\"146\" y=\"44\" width=\"244\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goal: puts others on game</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"126\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 151) scale(0.8)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-10 -18 v6 M10 -18 v6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-10 2 h4 M-2 2 h4 M6 2 h4 M-10 10 h4 M-2 10 h4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Licence in 3 earlier</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">years: law</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"184\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 209) scale(0.8)\"><circle cx=\"-9\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 16 V2 Q-9 -5 0 2 V16 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M1 18 V4 Q10 -3 19 4 V18 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Two new hunters at most:</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">law</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"242\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 267) scale(0.8)\"><circle r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"8\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$</text><line x1=\"-12\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"-12\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unpaid. Paid is guiding</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: Hunt Mentor&#x27;s ladder, not a BC rank.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Supervising is law: 3 prior licence years, at most two new hunters (99%, synopsis page 6).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the guide goal in words</summary><ul><li>Goal: puts others on game and keeps them safe (Tip).</li><li>In BC, supervising a youth or an initiation licence hunter needs, among other things, a hunting licence held in at least 3 of the licence years before this one (99%, synopsis page 6).</li><li>A supervisor may not take more than two youth or initiation licence hunters at a time (99%, page 6).</li><li>Taking someone hunting for pay or reward is guiding. It needs a guide licence (99%, synopsis page 11).</li><li>So \"Guide\" here means unpaid mentor, not a paid guide (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s6-guide\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:0\"><span>Met the 3 licence year rule on synopsis page 6</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:1\"><span>Took a new hunter out for a full day, safety talk first</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:2\"><span>Let them make the shot decision and talked them through it</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:3\"><span>Taught a partner to read the wind and a topo map</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:4\"><span>Led a hunt where I carried no rifle and only spotted</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-guide:5\"><span>Walked someone through field dressing and meat care</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Level 5, Old Timer. Goal: teaches and gives back. Key skills: mentored two or more new hunters; volunteered on a habitat project or a range or CORE practice day; kept a journal for ten seasons. Opinion, not a BC rank.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Level 5: Old Timer</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rookie</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"204\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apprentice</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunter</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guide</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"66\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Old Timer</text><path d=\"M6 290 V30 M132 290 V30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".5\"/><rect x=\"146\" y=\"44\" width=\"244\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goal: teaches, gives back</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"126\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 151) scale(0.8)\"><circle cx=\"-9\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 16 V2 Q-9 -5 0 2 V16 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M1 18 V4 Q10 -3 19 4 V18 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Mentored 2 new hunters</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"184\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 209) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M-10 18 V-2 M-10 -2 V-14 Q-6 -18 -3 -14 V-4 V-18 Q0 -22 3 -18 V-4 V-16 Q6 -20 9 -16 V2 L14 -6 Q19 -6 16 2 L6 18 Z\" fill=\"#f2d6c0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Habitat or range day</text><rect x=\"146\" y=\"242\" width=\"244\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(172 267) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M0 -12 Q-10 -18 -20 -14 V16 Q-10 12 0 18 Q10 12 20 16 V-14 Q10 -18 0 -12 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -12 V18\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"196\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Ten seasons of journal</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: Hunt Mentor&#x27;s ladder, not a BC rank.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Old Timer is not about age. It is what you hand on (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the old timer goal in words</summary><ul><li>Goal: teaches and gives back (Tip).</li><li>Old Timer is not about age. It is about what you hand on (Tip).</li><li>The synopsis ethics code: \"Be aware that you are a mentor when youth are observing.\" (99%, synopsis page 77)</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s6-oldtimer\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:0\"><span>Mentored two or more new hunters through their first season</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:1\"><span>Volunteered on a habitat or wildlife project</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:2\"><span>Gave a talk, a range day or a CORE (Conservation and Outdoor Recreation Education) practice day</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:3\"><span>Shared meat with someone who does not hunt</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:4\"><span>Reported a violation, or helped someone report one</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s6-oldtimer:5\"><span>Kept a journal for ten seasons and can show what it taught me</span></label></div>","<aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): The ladder has no top. The best hunters I knew still called themselves learners.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Ticking a box because you read the session. The box is for the field.</li><li>Rushing to Guide before you meet the 3 licence year rule for supervising.</li><li>Measuring yourself in antlers. Measure in clean kills, meat home and safe days.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Tonight, go through Rookie with your brother. Each tick needs a date and a place from your journal. If you cannot name it, leave it blank.</p></aside>","<ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly, checked 2026-10-02: page 6 (supervising hunter qualifications), page 11 (guiding needs a licence), page 77 (ethics: mentor when youth are observing). 99%.</li><li>The five levels, their goals and every checklist item: Hunt Mentor opinion, labelled Tip.</li><li>Accuracy target for Rookie (10 cm at 100 m): Hunt Mentor's own standard, a Tip, not a rule.</li></ul>"]